---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms and disclaimer" description="Terms of use and disclaimer for Pathfinder, an AI-generated study-abroad information service.">
  <PageHead eyebrow="Legal" title="Terms and disclaimer" lede="Plain-language terms for the pilot. The full terms will be published with the name of the legal operator before public launch." />
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>An AI-generated information service</h2>
      <p>
        Pathfinder provides general information generated and verified by automated AI agents, with no human review. It is not legal,
        immigration, financial or tax advice, and it does not create any adviser–client relationship.
      </p>
      <h2>Always check the official source</h2>
      <p>
        Rules, fees and deadlines change. Each fact shows its source and the date we verified it. Confirm on the official page before
        paying or applying. Where official information and Pathfinder differ, the official information applies.
      </p>
      <h2>No guarantees</h2>
      <p>We don’t predict or guarantee admission, visa, scholarship or employment outcomes.</p>
      <h2>What we won’t do</h2>
      <p>
        We won’t submit forms, pay fees or store passwords for official portals. We won’t help misrepresent documents, funds or history,
        and we won’t write essays for you.
      </p>
      <h2>Independence</h2>
      <p>We take no commissions or paid placements. See our <a href="/about#no-commission">no-commission policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
